  "content": "[Intro]\n[E5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[E5]Unity is a\nrare thing.\nBlind eyes of so-\nciety bring,\nThe category of mi-\nnority.\nNow what are we supposed\nto be?\n\n[Chorus]\n[E5]Born free\nto be\nPowerless to change\nthe world,\nWith our lives in the\nhands of madmen.\n\n[Bridge]\n[E5]\n[B5]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E5]Now in times when so-\nciety needs us.\nThis where the\nsin begins.\nWe're aware they're\ngoing to free us.\nRage from our hearts\nwithin.\n\n[Chorus]\n[E5]Born of\nthis world\nWhich is a li-\nving hell,\nBut we'll be\ncloser to heaven.\nSo\n\n[Bridge]\n[E5]now,\nthis is the art\nTo shred.\nIt's only emo-\ntion.\nThis is the art\nTo shred.\nIt's only emo-\ntion.\n\n[Instrumental]\n[E5]\n\n[Solo]\n[D5]\n[E5]  [F5]\n[G5]  [A5]\n[D5]\n[E5]  [F5]\n[G5]  [A5]\n[A5]\n[D5]\n[E5]  [F5]\n[G5]  [A5]\n[D5]\n[E5]  [F5]\n[G5]  [B5]\n[C5]  [D5]\n[D#5]\n\n[Outro]\n[E5]",
